{"script":"yd_036_04","des":"贝尔卡-熟识1","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"layer":"bg","noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","noIn":false,"addImg":"","y":-125,"mirrow":false,"x":-500,"scaleY":1.5,"bright":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"layer":"bg","noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","noIn":false,"addImg":"","y":-125,"mirrow":false,"x":-500,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1.5,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"img":"chara036_1","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1a","y":-218,"mirrow":false,"x":290,"scaleY":1,"bright":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"img":"chara036_1","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1a","y":-218,"mirrow":false,"x":290,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]你好！{myName}！嗯～我也不是每时每刻都在看书的啦，偶尔也会这样，进行水占师的日常训练。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1d","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]水占师也是秘术师，当然也要接受战斗训练啦。在这个深渊里，任何团体想要维持影响力，最重要的就是退治魔物、保护一方的能力。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]只有拥有足够的战斗力，我们才能为有需要的人们解决问题，为水神大人开拓新的道路。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]我们有很多训练项目……不过我个人比较偏爱的是范围攻击型的训练。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]毕竟对瞄准目标的要求不高，而且远程施法者只要保全自己就能发挥作用，比起近战来说多少可以稍稍偷懒一下吧～哈哈……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"}]}